#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I could help with that.
msgctxt "680_Kiryu"
msgid "(He just ran off with his uniform still on, so he should be easy to spot. I should try asking if anybody saw him.)"
msgstr "(Todavía lleva puesto su uniforme, así que debería ser fácil de reconocer.\n"
"Debería preguntar si alguien lo vio.)"

